---
// 每周页左侧的固定目录。一周页有五六个 h2，正文又长，读者需要一个不动的骨架。
//
// A fixed contents rail for a week page. It sits in the left margin, which is
// otherwise dead space at desktop widths, and it does not scroll away.
//
// 只收 h2。h3 在这个站里是段落内部的小标题，放进来目录就变成第二篇文章。
// Depth-2 only: h3 is used inside sections here, and including it would turn a
// six-item rail into a twenty-item one.
//
// 三种宽度三种处理：≥72rem 左边距里的固定导轨；中间宽度正文顶部一排行内链接；
// 手机上完全不渲染。手机那一档是因为每周正文开头的 outline 已经在说同样的事，
// 两个几乎重合的列表叠在一起，读者会以为自己看重了——而手机上竖向空间最紧，
// 行内那一排的收益也最小。
// Three widths, three treatments: a fixed rail in the left margin at 72rem and
// up, an inline row at the top of the column between there and the phone
// breakpoint, and nothing at all on a phone. The phone case is dropped because
// a week's prose now opens with an outline saying the same thing, and two
// near-identical lists stacked on top of each other read as a mistake. Vertical
// space is scarcest there and the inline row buys least.
//
// 颜色只用主题 token，没有 opacity。当前项用 --at-primary 的一道左边线，
// 不用颜色区分，因为琥珀在这个字号上只有 3.44:1。
// The current item is marked with an accent rule, not accent text: amber
// measures 3.44:1 on this background and these labels are 14px.
interface Heading {
  depth: number;
  slug: string;
  text: string;
}

interface Props {
  headings: Heading[];
}

const { headings } = Astro.props;

// 主题给每个标题挂了一个 "#" 锚点，它会被算进 heading.text，所以要剥掉。
// The theme appends a "#" anchor to each heading, and Astro's `headings` picks
// it up as part of the text. Strip it, or every rail item ends in a hash.
const items = headings
  .filter((heading) => heading.depth === 2)
  .map((heading) => ({ ...heading, text: heading.text.replace(/\s*#\s*$/, "") }));
---

{
  items.length > 2 && (
    <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
      <p class="toc__title">On this page</p>
      <ol class="toc__list">
        {items.map((heading) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`#${heading.slug}`}>{heading.text}</a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </nav>
  )
}

<style>
  /* 两种形态，同一份标记：
     宽屏——左边距里的固定导轨；
     窄屏——正文顶部的一排行内链接，而不是整个消失。
     之前只有前一种，断点定在 87rem，结果作者自己的窗口就看不到它。
     Two forms, one markup: a fixed rail in the left margin when the margin is
     wide enough to hold it, and an inline row of links at the top of the column
     when it is not. The first version only had the rail and hid it below 87rem,
     which is wider than the window this site is actually read in. */

  .toc {
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    padding-block: 0.85rem;
    border-block: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);
  }

  /* 40rem 和 [slug].astro 里零件表用的是同一个断点，"手机" 在这个仓库里就是它。
     The phone breakpoint, shared with the parts table in [slug].astro. */
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .toc {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .toc__title {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--at-text-secondary);
  }

  .toc__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .toc__list a {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--at-text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .toc__list a:hover,
  .toc__list a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--at-text);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .toc__list li.is-current a {
    color: var(--at-text);
  }

  /* 断点是 72rem（1152px，媒体查询里的 rem 按 16px 算，不是根的 18px）。
     它是算出来的，不是挑出来的：导轨要至少 170px 才容得下一个会换行的条目，
     而 [slug].astro 里那组式子在 1152px 上给出 234px，再窄就不够了。
     整组居中之后这个断点比原来低：正文会右让，导轨不必再挤剩下的半边。
     改这个值要连 [slug].astro 里的那个一起改。
     The breakpoint is derived, not chosen: the rail needs ~170px to hold an
     item that wraps, and the sizing in [slug].astro yields 234px at 1152px.
     Centring the group lowered it — the column gives way instead of the rail
     being crushed. Keep it in step with the one in [slug].astro. */
  @media (min-width: 72rem) {
    .toc {
      position: fixed;
      top: 12rem;
      /* 导轨就是这一整组最左边那一段，所以直接从组的左缘量起，不用再从中线倒推。
         四分之一不是二分之一：整组视觉居中，左边余量只占剩余的四分之一，
         这个除数要和 [slug].astro 的左轨道一致，改一个就要改另一个。
         --week-band / --week-col / --week-rail 都定义在 [slug].astro。
         The quarter, not a half: the group is optically centred, so the left
         margin takes a quarter of the leftover. This divisor has to match the
         left track in [slug].astro — change one and you change both.
         这里是 100vw，而 body 的轨道用的是 100%：fixed 定位的百分比只认视口，
         没法跟 body 的内容盒同基准。macOS 的浮层滚动条下两者相等，
         这个站也是在那里读和评的；换成占位滚动条会差半个滚动条宽。
         The rail is simply the leftmost run of the centred group, so it is
         measured from that group's left edge. The variables are set in
         [slug].astro, which owns the page's geometry. This uses 100vw where
         the tracks use 100%, because a fixed element resolves percentages
         against the viewport and cannot share body's content box. They agree
         under macOS overlay scrollbars, which is where this site is read and
         marked; a classic scrollbar would offset the rail by half its width. */
      left: calc((100vw - var(--week-band) - var(--week-col)) / 4);
      width: var(--week-rail);
      max-height: calc(100vh - 16rem);
      overflow-y: auto;
      margin: 0;
      padding-block: 0;
      border: 0;
    }

    .toc__list {
      display: block;
      border-inline-start: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 20%, transparent);
    }

    .toc__list li {
      padding-inline-start: 1rem;
      border-inline-start: 2px solid transparent;
      margin-inline-start: -1px;
    }

    /* 条目会换行，所以条目之间的空隙必须明显大于行距，否则两个标题读起来像一个。
       行距 1.35 约 6px，条目间距 0.9rem 约 16px，差不多两倍半。
       Items wrap here, so the space between them has to beat the space inside
       them: ~6px between lines against ~16px between items. */
    .toc__list li + li {
      margin-block-start: 0.9rem;
    }

    .toc__list a {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
      display: block;
    }

    .toc__list li.is-current {
      border-inline-start-color: var(--at-primary);
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // 当前读到哪一节，用 IntersectionObserver 标出来。脚本没跑也没关系：
  // 目录仍然是一串可用的锚点链接，只是不高亮。
  //
  // Progressive enhancement: without this the rail is still a working list of
  // anchors. `scroll` listeners are not used anywhere in this repo.
  const rail = document.querySelector(".toc");
  if (rail) {
    const links = new Map<string, HTMLElement>();
    for (const anchor of rail.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>("a[href^='#']")) {
      const parent = anchor.parentElement;
      if (parent) links.set(decodeURIComponent(anchor.hash.slice(1)), parent);
    }

    const seen = new Set<string>();
    const mark = () => {
      for (const [id, li] of links) li.classList.toggle("is-current", seen.has(id));
    };

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        for (const entry of entries) {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) seen.add(entry.target.id);
          else seen.delete(entry.target.id);
        }
        // 屏幕上同时有几节时，只留最上面那一节。
        const visible = [...seen];
        if (visible.length > 1) {
          const first = [...links.keys()].find((id) => seen.has(id));
          seen.clear();
          if (first) seen.add(first);
        }
        mark();
      },
      { rootMargin: "0px 0px -70% 0px" },
    );

    for (const id of links.keys()) {
      const heading = document.getElementById(id);
      if (heading) observer.observe(heading);
    }
  }
</script>
